@startuml layers
title apps/starchess — import layers (enforced by .dependency-cruiser.cjs)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "routes" {
  [screens] as screens
  [demos] as demos
}
package "app side" {
  [app] as app
  [tutorial] as tutorial
  [achievements] as ach
}
package "presentation" {
  [animations] as anim
  [pieces] as pieces
  [board / combat / hud / specials / timeline] as pres
}
package "components" {
  [features] as features
  [atoms] as atoms
  [primitives] as prims
}
[store (UI-wide flags)] as store
[hooks] as hooks
[adapters] as adapters
[types] as types

screens --> demos
screens --> app
demos --> app
app --> pres
app --> components
pres --> anim
anim --> pieces
pres --> components
features --> atoms
atoms --> prims
pres --> store
components --> store
app --> adapters
pres --> adapters

pieces -[#red,dashed]-> anim : pieces-below-animations
prims -[#red,dashed]-> pres : primitives-stay-presentational\n(known: PromotionModal → PieceGlyph)
atoms -[#red,dashed]-> features : atoms-below-features
components -[#red,dashed]-> screens : components-below-routes
pres -[#red,dashed]-> app : presentation-below-app\n(known: 29 edges)
store -[#red,dashed]-> pres : store-below-ui
types -[#red,dashed]-> app : types-are-leaves

note right of pres
  Known violations (baseline, 30 in
  .dependency-cruiser-known-violations.json):
  • hud (TurnBar, TurnBarSidebar, ResourceBar,
    GasRack, DeployModal) → MatchStoreContext,
    selectors, matchEconomy
  • specials arms + pieceSpecials → matchEconomy
  • board (LiveStarChessBoard, useBoardInput),
    combat (useIntentOverlays) → selectors,
    intentOverlayPolicy, MatchStoreContext,
    achievementLive
  These are the edges that fold 11 layers into one
  strongly connected cluster. Paying one off: move
  the selector / economy read behind a prop or a
  presentation-side port, then run
  check:deps:baseline so the baseline shrinks.
end note

note bottom
  pnpm lint runs oxlint, then check:deps (--ignore-known): a new violation fails,
  a paid-off one goes stale — regenerate with check:deps:baseline.
  Type-only imports are exempt everywhere (they vanish at runtime);
  cycles are judged on runtime edges only.
  timers-through-adapter: only adapters/ and MatchStoreContext import adapters/browser.
end note
@enduml
